---
import Marketing from '../layouts/Marketing.astro';
---

<Marketing title="About" description="About MCP Warp.">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About MCP Warp</h1>
    <p>
      MCP Warp is ngrok for MCP servers. You run MCP servers on your own machine, and MCP Warp
      gives each one a public, OAuth-protected URL that Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, VS Code and
      other MCP clients can connect to — without you having to run or manage any infrastructure.
    </p>

    <h2>Who builds it</h2>
    <p>
      MCP Warp is built by <a href="https://anatoly.dev">Anatoly</a> (<a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anatolyt/">LinkedIn</a
      >).
    </p>

    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>MCP Warp is in early access and actively developed.</p>

    <h2>Links</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/mcpwarp">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="mailto:support@mcpwarp.io">support@mcpwarp.io</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Marketing>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .about h1 {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .about h2 {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .about a {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }
  .about a:hover {
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  }
</style>
